flowchart TB
  accTitle: Responsibility and authority map for the composed runtime
  accDescr: B1 owns memory accessibility, B2 owns bounded typed recovery, B3 owns workspace admission and broadcast, B4 owns intention and method decisions, B6 owns cross-stage risk and resource authorization, and GraSP owns skill-graph execution. A coordinator checks event identity and versions but does not replace these governors.
  C[Protocol coordinator]
  B1[B1 Memory policy]
  B2[B2 Recovery governor]
  B3[B3 Workspace governor]
  B4[B4 Intention governor]
  B6[B6 Resource governor]
  G[GraSP Skill governor]
  C -. event routing and version checks .-> B1
  C -. event routing and version checks .-> B2
  C -. event routing and version checks .-> B3
  C -. event routing and version checks .-> B4
  C -. event routing and version checks .-> B6
  C -. event routing and version checks .-> G
  classDef authority fill:#EAF4FB,stroke:#1A4A8A,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef coordinator fill:#F4F4F4,stroke:#888888,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.2px
  class C coordinator
  class B1,B2,B3,B4,B6,G authority
